{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2021-09", "window": 2, "start_date": 1631059200, "end_date": 1631750399, "month_true_total": 151, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:50:49 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "99417967", "author": {"steamid": "76561198185233191", "personaname": "AlcatrezNomad", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198185233191/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 9729, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 973, "last_played": 1754539627, "avatar": "d2576b7583d810c44de3c30601900800a10e8b65"}, "language": "english", "review": "good crazy co-op fun", "timestamp_created": 1631748775, "timestamp_updated": 1631748775, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99415670", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982544602", "personaname": "GOLOLOL", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Gol22/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 17452, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4842, "last_played": 1780188437, "avatar": "65b9be64ddc8fe08b8b980b929b9ef197da8d127"}, "language": "english", "review": "Easily the best game to play with friends. Plenty of chaos to be had~", "timestamp_created": 1631744384, "timestamp_updated": 1631744384, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99413523", "author": {"steamid": "76561198348826816", "personaname": "Robin_L_Fox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198348826816/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 21, "playtime_forever": 10980, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5385, "last_played": 1751246507, "avatar": "d744f9a2d6e14452c00edb5bafa30a73595cf121"}, "language": "english", "review": "\"'Ate Alphas\n'Ate Omegas\n'Ate Flying Type\n'Ate the dropships\n'Ate the Air Raider\n(He blew Gus up the other night)\n\nLuv EDF\nLuv me gunz\nLuv me mech\nLuv killin' bugs\nEarth stands\n\nSimple As.\"\n~ Storm 1", "timestamp_created": 1631740559, "timestamp_updated": 1631740559, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99387541", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100172486", "personaname": "Vandrike", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198100172486/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 11768, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4078, "last_played": 1719280975, "avatar": "0caf4d7e39c418397978e109e5f07b1c6bfa4fb1"}, "language": "english", "review": "After 65 hours 16 minutes and 10 seconds  I have completed my first run through of EDF. A game untouched by limits, higher and higher you soar with a scope that refuses to be constrained. Each time you think you've peaked you find yourself looking back up at another mountain lain before you begging for you to rise to the occasion. Truly this game stands apart as it sends you neck deep into a horde of a variety of aliens and monsters as part of the valiant infantry, and I'm damn proud to have fought alongside them.\n\nOh we are the valiant infantry.\nWe are the alpha team with passion and camaraderie.\nHear us as we shout at the top our lungs, be calm and be bold and raise your guns!\nHigh up in the air our comrades fight, dashing through the sky now like million bolts of light.\nWe shall spread out wings wide and fly high, soaring, gliding through the endless sky!\nIt's only with our sacrifice, that mankind can still exist in paradise.\nTo defend our dearest Mother Earth, we're ready to give up our lives!", "timestamp_created": 1631704719, "timestamp_updated": 1631704719, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "99379840", "author": {"steamid": "76561198067574377", "personaname": "Teizan", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/teizan0/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 62, "playtime_forever": 3988, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1972, "last_played": 1726211421, "avatar": "e81bec5341fc1815e80db9bb97e6624b75511841"}, "language": "english", "review": "Minding my own business trying to pick up as many loot crates as I can in a dramatic battle, and a big damn robot has been punched hard enough to knock it over - crashing down with the full weight of such a behemoth close enough to fill my screen - and uses it's jump jets to get back up and keep fighting? That was pretty cinematic, not going to lie.\n\nGame's a good, mindless loot-and-shoot. That said, it's absolutely not worth asking price at present.", "timestamp_created": 1631689078, "timestamp_updated": 1654836534, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}]}